<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Kevin Hu</title>
  {% include 'head.j2' %}
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.nerdfonts.com/assets/css/webfont.css">
</head>
<body>
  {% include 'header.j2' %}
  <main>
    <section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="welcome">
      <div>
        <h1 id="welcome">Hi, I'm Kevin Hu.</h1>
        <p class="home-lead">I'm a Computer Information Technology student at BCIT. I work on my homelab and build practical tools for people to use.</p>
        <details class="about-me" open>
          <summary>
            <span class="summary-more">Read more</span>
            <span class="summary-less">Show less</span>
          </summary>
          <p>I've been tinkering with computers and software since I was a teenager, and that led me into video production, web development, and systems work. Over time, I grew YouTube channels to more than 25,000 subscribers, which taught me how to plan, edit, and finish projects end to end.</p>
          <p>In 2022, I got into self-hosting and homelabbing, which pushed me deeper into open-source software, home automation, networking, and infrastructure. What started with simple hardware fixes turned into a home setup with servers, storage, virtualization, VLANs, and VPN access. I also build web applications and like using practical tools to solve real problems for myself and my family.</p>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="home-social">
        <h2>Find me online</h2>
        <div class="home-social-links">
          <a class="home-social-link" href="https://github.com/vttc08" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>GitHub</span><i class="nf nf-cod-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </a>
          <a class="home-social-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevin-zhi-shu-hu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>LinkedIn</span><i class="nf nf-dev-linkedin" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-projects" aria-labelledby="projects">
      <h2 id="projects">Projects</h2>
      {% from "project-card.j2" import project_card %}
      <nav class="project-filter" aria-label="Filter posts by category">
        <button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter-value="all">All</button>
        <button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter-value="featured">Awards</button>
        <button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter-value="homelab">Homelab</button>
        <button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter-value="development">Development</button>
        <button class="filter-button" type="button" data-filter-value="media">Media</button>
      </nav>
      <div class="card-list">
        {% for project in projects %}
          {{ project_card(project, initially_hidden=project.featured) }}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
<script>
  const details = document.querySelector(".about-me");
  const mobile = window.matchMedia("(max-width: 768px)");

  function updateAboutLayout(event) {
    details.open = !event.matches;
  }
  updateAboutLayout(mobile);
  mobile.addEventListener("change", updateAboutLayout);
</script>
</body>
{% include 'footer.j2' %}
</html>
